    "title": "Day in Photos: 99-Year-Old Royal Air Force Veteran, Forest Fires in Israel, and Revamped Venus Grotto",
    "text": "99-year-old Royal Air Force veteran Dennis Bishop poses for a photograph in the door of an Airbus A400M Atlas aircraft, during a VE Day 80 media event at RAF Brize Norton, in Oxfordshire, UK, on April 30, 2025. Bishop served during World War II as a ground radio operator and landed at Normandy after the main landings. He also served in Africa and Europe during the war.\nDay in Photos: 99-Year-Old Royal Air Force Veteran, Forest Fires in Israel, and Revamped Venus Grotto\nA glimpse into the world through the lens of photography.\nMore Photo Pages\nsee more",
